    "menuGroupHelp": "Help",
    "moduleInfoDevices": "List of GPS devices (vehicles). The device ID (IMEI) must match the tracker exactly. Use Connections to set geofences, alerts and commands per device.",
    "moduleInfoDevice": "Device details. The device ID (IMEI) must match what the tracker sends. Expiration = end of the subscription: after it the server refuses new connections from the device, so new data is not stored (a device that is still connected may keep sending until it reconnects).",
    "moduleInfoGroupCommand": "Send one command to EVERY device in this group at once. Be careful with Block engine.",
    "moduleInfoDeviceCommand": "Send a command to this device right now (e.g. Block / Unblock engine). It is delivered when the device is online; otherwise it can wait in a queue if the device supports it.",
    "moduleInfoGroups": "Group devices together. Geofences, alerts, settings and access given to a group apply to every device in it.",
    "moduleInfoGeofences": "Virtual fences on the map. Link them to devices or groups, then create 'Geofence entered / exited' alerts.",
    "moduleInfoNotifications": "Rules for when alerts are sent (e.g. ignition on, geofence exit, overspeed) and through which channels enabled on the server (web, email, Telegram, …).",
    "moduleInfoCommands": "Ready-made commands for trackers, e.g. Block / Unblock engine. Link them to users or devices allowed to use them.",
    "moduleInfoMaintenance": "Service reminders by distance, engine hours or date.",
    "moduleInfoCalendars": "Schedules (e.g. working hours) to limit when alerts or geofences are active.",
    "moduleInfoAttributes": "Advanced: formulas that calculate new values from device data. Leave as is if unsure.",
    "moduleInfoBilling": "Subscription period per device and payment records (only admins record payments). After the expiration date the server refuses new connections from the device, so new data is not stored; a device that is still connected may keep sending until it reconnects. Each device keeps about its last 12 payments; export regularly for a complete record.",
    "moduleInfoConsents": "Proof that each user accepted the terms and location-data consent, with time and version.",
    "moduleInfoUsers": "Accounts that can log in: customers, resellers and admins. Use Connections to give access to devices.",
    "moduleInfoUser": "Account details: name, email, password, time zone and units, limits and permissions.",
    "moduleInfoAnnouncement": "Send a message to selected users through a notification channel (e.g. web or email).",
    "moduleInfoServer": "System-wide settings (admins only): maps, units, default permissions and attributes such as time zone.",
    "moduleInfoPreferences": "Display settings for your account: map (layers, live trail, clustering), device list title/detail, alert sounds, access token and app/server version info.",
    "moduleInfoAccumulators": "Correct a device's odometer and engine hours.",
    "moduleInfoShare": "Create a temporary link to share a device's location with someone.",
    "moduleInfoReportCombined": "Positions and events together in one report.",
